WEBVTT - His Girl Friday (English Subtitles)

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:07.000
[Typewriters clattering rapidly in the busy Morning Post newsroom]

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:15.000
Walter Burns: "Hildy! Where have you been? I've been looking all over for you!"

00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:23.000
Hildy Johnson: "I told you, Walter, I'm quitting the newspaper business."

00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:31.000
Walter: "Quitting? You can't quit! You're a newspaperman, the best we've got!"

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Hildy: "I want to be a woman, Walter. I'm getting married tomorrow."

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:50.000
Walter: "Married? To whom? What kind of practical joke is this?"

00:00:52.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Hildy: "His name is Bruce Baldwin. He's in the insurance business in Albany."
